@startuml
title 实验三实现映射（领域对象以关系记录持久化）
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #396774
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F0F7F5
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F0F7F5
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F0F7F5
skinparam roundcorner 8
hide empty members
class User {
 +id: UUID
 +account: String {unique}
 -passwordHash: String
 +enabled: Boolean
 +admin: Boolean
}
class Product {
 +id: UUID
 +title: String
 +price: Decimal(7,2)
 +status: ProductStatus
 +version: Long
 +restricted: Boolean
 +publishedAt: Instant
 +changeDetails()
}
class Category {
 +id: UUID
}
class Reservation {
 +id: UUID
 +status: ReservationStatus
 +priceSnapshot: Decimal(7,2)
 +buyerConfirmed: Boolean
 +sellerConfirmed: Boolean
 +confirmationEpoch: Long
 +completedAt: Instant?
 +confirmDelivery(actor, epoch)
}
class Cancellation {
 +id: UUID
 +status: Pending/Approved/Rejected/Withdrawn/Closed
 +reason: String
 +decide()
}
class ReviewRecord {
 +decision: String
 +reason: String
 +productVersion: Long
}
class AuditLog {
 +actorId: UUID
 +action: String
 +beforeAfter: JSON
 +outcome: String
 +occurredAt: Instant
}
class RequestReceipt {
 +actorId: UUID
 +requestKey: UUID
 +payloadHash: String
 +result: JSON
}
User "1" -- "0..*" Product : 卖家
User "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : 买家
Product "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : 历史预约
Category "1" -- "0..*" Product
Reservation "1" *-- "0..*" Cancellation
Product "1" -- "0..*" ReviewRecord
User "1" -- "0..*" ReviewRecord : 审核者
User "1" -- "0..*" AuditLog : 操作者
User "1" -- "0..*" RequestReceipt
note bottom of Reservation
有效状态：PENDING、CONFIRMED、CANCEL_PENDING
每商品最多一条有效预约（数据库部分唯一索引）
取消拒绝/撤回：清空双方标记并递增confirmationEpoch
防止旧确认请求在标记重置后再次生效
end note
note bottom of Product
0 < price <= 99999.99，最多两位小数
同一User可同时买卖；不拆成互斥子类
end note

note "Python实现：User为dataclass；其余对象由关系表和服务方法承载。\n金额在SQLite中用整数分保存；Decimal仅用于输入校验。\n管理员在途关闭增加取消申请Closed终态，避免残留待处理申请。" as Implementation
@enduml
